category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libapr1-devel libaprutil1-devel libesmtp-devel libexpat-devel libfmt-devel libiodbc-devel libQt5Core-devel zip
sdesc: "Logging framework for C++ patterned after Apache log4j (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "Apache log4cxx is a logging framework for C++ patterned after Apache log4j,
which uses Apache Portable Runtime for most platform-specific code and should
be usable on any platform supported by APR."
skip:

homepage: https://logging.apache.org/log4cxx/latest_stable/
license: Apache-2.0
